:[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"El Alamein - La linea del fuoco","overview":"1942: ad El Alamein si combatte una battaglia decisiva tra le truppe inglesi e l'esercito italo/tedesco, che vedrà la sconfitta cocente di queste ultime e l'inizio del lento e inesorabile declino delle forze dell'asse italo-tedesco."},{"language":"en-US","title":"El Alamein: The Line of Fire","overview":"War seen through the eyes of Serra, a university student from Palermo who volunteers in 1942 to fight in Africa. He is assigned to the Pavia Division on the southern line in Egypt. Rommel and the Axis forces are bogged down; it's October, the British prepare an offensive. At first, boredom, heat, hunger, and thirst bedevil the Italians; then the Brits attack, and there's no luck or heroism in death. Finally, it's retreat in confusion. Serra, his sergeant Rizzo, and his lieutenant Fiori take a last walk toward home. It's said that each soldier gets three miracles; when Serra's are used up, what then?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oissF98kCI36KoldyVB8UMAY0KD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/WT6DJukD0oNQ3r3e9YfFLQ8lae.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":26495,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oissF98kCI36KoldyVB8UMAY0KD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oissF98kCI36KoldyVB8UMAY0KD.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oissF98kCI36KoldyVB8UMAY0KD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oissF98kCI36KoldyVB8UMAY0KD.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xEwhYa1ujViWRSHUvSfqXmyLLHE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w30